						 <blockquote> <p><strong>A Surprise Encounter with Crispy Sex Pirates</strong><br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600579077" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span></p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;">▷ <strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/spc-993" target="_blank">Entry for DAY TWO</a></strong> ◁</p> <p style="text-align: center;">▷ <strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4190" target="_blank">Entry for DAY THREE</a></strong> ◁</p> <hr /> <p>This is a tale for <strong>Day 1</strong> of the <strong><a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/144-hour-jam-contest">144-Hour Jam Contest</a></strong>. The theme was &quot;Shaggy Dog story&quot;.</p> <p>&quot;Crispy Sex Pirates&quot; was created accidentally in <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1553042&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600579077" alt="PeppersGhost" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1553042)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" >PeppersGhost</a></span> (and botnik)'s <strong><a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-botnik-j">SCP-\̅\̅\̅\̅-J</a></strong>.</p> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷&nbsp;Special&nbsp;Thanks</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:110%;"><strong>Special Thanks &#8212; Critters &amp; Beta Readers</strong></span